## Analyst Assessment

DET-006 successfully contributed to the multi-stage correlation exercise, but retrospective investigation demonstrated that the underlying detection logic is too broad for long-term SOC use.

A production-quality detection should distinguish:

```text
Normal Successful Logon
        |
        X
      DET-006
```

from:

```text
Remote Network Logon
        +
Administrative Context
        |
        v
      DET-006
```

This refinement should reduce unrelated results while preserving visibility into suspicious remote administrative activity.

